# Foli Kan Drumming Ensemble

What a brilliant show these guys put on for the Afro Foli Festival. The amazing Dale Anderson created these tees with hand embroidered djembes. She is definitely a costume genius! Once again, thanks to all Foli Kan members for your dedication and hard work preparing for the Afro Foli Festival. It is such a treat having you all as part of the Rhythm Culture crew. For several years now, these members have attended countless performances and traveled here, there and everywhere for our Rhythm Culture jams and shows! Thanks for your help and if you would like to see them in action please keep posted on our [Facebook page](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ/?fref=ts) for upcoming events!
